<description>&lt;p&gt;CAR forces have completed Rwanda special forces and basic special operations training and have neutralised 34 Boko Haram and ISWAP fighters in the Lake Chad area. The UN Security Council renewed the MINUSCA mandate to 2027, lowered the troop ceiling to 12,000 and ordered a gradual drawdown of peacekeepers, while the UN mission was extended. Saudi backing now funds a second year of a Sahel counter-terrorism programme centred on Chad, and tensions rise between Chad and Niger after a prison break in Chad that caused two inmate deaths and 30 escapes. Wagner’s gold interests continue to block peace efforts, and 246 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxOVXZOcW5JS2MyMGx1LWVWT1VVQy1oNkpDeGtBaURiQnVsRzBpbHJqcGhIWEYxenVWODRkRE91b0pLQU1KaHJqZDdqWUluWldmWk5ia3J4Q25idmtMUFduWG52dnl6ZFp2Qy1VOVlCWmtXYWVlNjJvM1dXVlRMdzFsMGtBblkyajhweFFuVmFoVXFDSFkzM2NNdW5LRVluNXVtMGp6STdvTmhTaWFBd2NwXzBKQnF0Mnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxPbXBTWXAxSzhjTnV6Qy01TXZ3VlY4NmtTS0UtdWVHMVJUUjNEUEl6b1hKM2JiTEg3cjdlTVd1T3BjcDhaODc5YVFFblBOeW9mU3Vrb253UjlzQ09TRzBVS280Qk1yNEc2NzdZYVh1MWhqa2VRMVhUWnFtX3FZOWVsag?oc=5&quot;&gt;HIAS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxNWjV6S2RSWFJYbGlyR3FoOW40azBoU0UxOXR5b2NyUG92TS1MdWpMRmFLenRReWNWVWc2RTJjenFKWGtWdlRuSjFac3hvVml4NHJwWGhCZ2kyd25scWQ5SkdwaUdGOEI3LWh3R3BPTWYwVEwweHl0SmxCZ2g3Q05ESVR3dWhDb05RSFgtZm9tWS0?oc=5&quot;&gt;Wisevoter&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOSHpRU1pDcDlaZ2M0UnVJSE1HRjJCcmFxcGNZdWxOdk5TUG50R0ptYzdHVXdDZGVDZERicG9BV1pybjdZZURFS0lzSm15eTd4NWdXUjByQ3hhN184OG5JUXFwW